WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow
I'm in a complete daze under the sun

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow
Guided only by my flowering love for you

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Hirakeyo inochi no hana
Let the flower of life bloom

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Akaku atsuku midasarete
Let it follow its red hot desires

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
Fujouri na mirai no kodou
This flame runs through the pulses

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Kakenukeru honoo
Of the absurd future

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.570
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne
I feel it tingling inside me

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.070
Yokubou
Desire

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:45.820
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:50.740
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru
And turns into great pleasure

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:56.590
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto
I'm sure you don't know yet

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:03.220
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:08.190
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai
I want to hold on to these newborn desires

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:11.480
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne
More wild than soft

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:14.680
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa
That will make my day

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:21.270
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:23.120
Dare ga mamoru
That I can only see for myself?

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:29.640
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo
I can do it, so love me truly

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.490
<b>Buou Academy</b>

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.290
It's gotten pretty late, hasn't it?

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:38.530
It was worth traveling to the Tokugawa mansion, though.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:42.610
There's so much we could learn about the Samurai Brides.

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:46.420
And thanks to our qi training, we can now sense the presence of enemies as well.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:49.720
But the Dark Samurai are still leagues ahead of us.

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:50.300
That's true.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:55.430
We need to uncover the secret of the Samurai Brides before the deadline.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:56.020
Oh.

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:56.640
What's wrong?

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:57.940
My boot...

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:59.690
It'll be too hard to walk in that.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:01.930
There might be an open shop somewhere around here.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.110
I'll go check.

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:05.030
Wait!

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:07.820
Yukimura-sama, people have been attacked by a slasher around here.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.810
Don't underestimate me like that.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:12.580
Just stay put for a bit.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.330
Yukimura-sama!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.540
That's qi!

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:19.750
Could it be a Dark Samurai?

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.950
Wh-What the... A familiar?

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.300
Where? Where is that stone?

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:32.290
I see! So you're that slasher?

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.350
This is the perfect opportunity to see the fruits of my labor.

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:37.480
Come! I'll be your opponent!

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:44.050
Wh-What's this weird qi?

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:45.980
I can't move!

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:50.890
That direction!

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.160
No way!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.070
Tell me where the Guardian Stone is!

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.620
Yukimura-sama!

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.000
Wh-What on Earth is that?!

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:03.250
R-Run away, Matabei!

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:12.010
Tell me! Where is the Guardian Stone?

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.100
Tell me!

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.260
What is this?!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:25.940
No! Don't get in my way!

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:39.080
Don't you understand what it means to be revived?

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.370
I just want to remain true to myself.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.170
You fool.

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:43.960
Heed my words.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:46.710
You cannot escape fate!

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.380
Matabei, are you okay?

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.510
Yes!

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:53.430
Where did it go?

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:54.470
I don't know.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.050
It just vanished.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.010
What the heck was that?

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.310
The next day

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:02.940
The coal burner

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:07.420
<b>Kiss practice</b>

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:07.440
Matabei-san.
<b>Kiss practice</b>

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.690
<b>Kiss practice
Matabei-san.</b>

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:08.700
Matabei-san.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:12.630
What are you doing here?

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:15.050
We were almost out of coal in the kitchen.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:16.160
I see.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.450
You were really hit bad last night.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:19.830
Yeah.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.070
A slasher got you?

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.460
Are you okay? Yukki? Beta-san?

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.250
Yeah, we aren't hurt.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:30.250
But when it used its qi, we couldn't move.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.390
The same as all the other cases.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.720
How can you lose to a mere slasher?

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:38.180
It wasn't any old slasher!

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:40.100
It was basically a real monster.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:47.030
If it really <i>is</i> a monster, then it'll be good practice to fight it before we clash with the Dark Samurai!

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:50.290
Not to mention we'd be protecting the peace of the Academy.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.280
Two birds with one stone!

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.610
Or could it be that you're scared?

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:59.080
I was planning on revenge myself!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.850
Are you fine with that, Muneakira?

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:02.090
I get it.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:05.790
But the Dark Samurai's deadline is drawing near.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.420
You mustn't overexert yourself.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.500
That's my only condition.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:10.170
Yes.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.230
All right, let's do this!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.260
I couldn't do anything.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.050
Yukimura-sama's life was in danger,

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.010
yet I was unable to do anything.

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:22.270
It's so vexing!

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:26.020
Matabei-san, I know the exact feeling.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.490
I've been worried as of late.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:38.240
It feels like there's nothing I can do to aid in the battle against the Dark Samurai.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.890
I feel the same.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:44.450
And just thinking that they could defeat us because I lack power...

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:49.580
I really don't want to consider it,
but what would happen to us if we lost?

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:52.920
What would happen to this dojo?

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:57.390
The curse on Muneakira-san's arms wouldn't be lifted,

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.970
and he wouldn't be able to run this dojo.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:05.970
And if he were gone, Milady and I would have no reason to stay here anymore.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:09.530
The same applies to Yukimura-sama, Sasuke, and me.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.410
Even Kanetsugu would leave.

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:19.070
I don't think Juubei-san and Gisen-san would want to stay here without Muneakira-san.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.740
Everyone would leave, right?

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:24.660
Most likely.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.830
Even though we've been getting along so well...

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.670
Indeed.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.890
We really have no other choice but to become stronger.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.130
<b>The next morning</b>

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.890
Huh? You want to hunt down a slasher?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:43.110
The deadline's right around the corner.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.640
What on Earth are you thinking?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:48.680
Then why are <i>you</i> training?

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:52.440
I-I'm just taking a morning bath!

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:56.900
It's not like I'm mimicking Keiji's training or anything!

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:01.820
Sacchin and I need to head out for our next training session.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:02.740
I hope you don't mind.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.670
I guess I managed to stay in the hot water longer, then!

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:08.870
See you!

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.420
It's so hot!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:21.180
Someone is prowling in the night.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:24.140
We got word about it two weeks ago.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:26.210
That long ago?

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:29.350
We know nothing about the culprit, though.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:35.060
The victims all say that they couldn't move once the culprit stared at them.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:39.780
They don't remember the culprit's face or other physical characteristics.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.320
It's the same with us.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:45.650
So there have been sightings for two weeks now.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.120
That's about the time the Dark Samurai showed up.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:52.550
Do you think one of them might be the culprit?

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:55.840
No. While I can't deny the possibility,

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.510
I think its qi was different from that of the Dark Samurai.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:04.330
And you said the culprit was looking for some sort of stone?

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.300
Yes. It was asking about a "Guardian Stone."

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:08.310
Guardian Stone?

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:12.610
Judging from its name, it must be a stone protecting something.

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:17.310
We need to investigate this matter immediately.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.130
Indeed.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:21.150
I think I've heard about the Guardian Stone before.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.650
Really, milady?

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:25.320
A new qi user, huh?

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:29.660
Ah, just the crows.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:31.370
There have been more of them recently.

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:33.830
They're so ominous.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.330
Training

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:50.390
Sacchin?

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:56.230
What's wrong, Sacchin?

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.520
Huh? The crows are following us?

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:08.370
Wait, Sacchin! We can't just stop training!

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:20.750
We meet again.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.690
You've turned into a Master Samurai, haven't you?

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.430
Sacchin!

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:30.760
Where are you?

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.350
Ah, Sacchin!

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:35.890
Don't leave me alone like that.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.520
Oh, you're...

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:41.820
Um...

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.530
Who are you again?

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:49.530
Teahouse

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:54.580
Was it Houzouin In... In...

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:55.830
Inshun.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:10:01.880
Yeah! Houzouin In... In...

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.420
Can I call you Inko-chan?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:05.260
No?

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:07.010
Fine.

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:08.720
Hurray!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.470
Oh, right! I know of a really nice place!

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:13.310
Let's go, Inko-chan!

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:15.470
Dark Samurai

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:20.900
Inshun and Mataemon are gone again?

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:25.150
Seems so. Even though the deadline is drawing closer.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:26.530
Indeed.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:27.400
Kojiro!

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:30.610
I'm bored. Come with me.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.370
Aren't you bothered?

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.200
What's the point of worrying about people who aren't around?

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:41.550
Not about that. About the reason why we were revived.

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:42.750
Not really.

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:45.170
I'm quite bothered by it.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:48.550
What if those two know something?

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:51.180
So long as I get to fight someone strong, I don't really care.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:56.030
A dual-wielding samurai just like me, Yagyuu Juubei!

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.180
Juubei

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:00.100
This way! This way!

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:02.100
Inshun

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:05.860
Look at that!

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:12.320
This is the best spot to look at Mt. Fuji.

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:17.410
You're new here, so I was pretty sure that you didn't know about this place.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:25.170
Ah, I forgot to ring the noisy ones!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.670
One, two!

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:32.590
It's fun!

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:33.550
Here.

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:36.140
Inko-chan, you try it, too. It's fun!

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.640
Swing it with all your might!

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:46.980
Are you okay?

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:49.450
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:53.610
Fortunes

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:55.870
<b>Fortunes
I'll draw a good one this time!</b>

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:56.910
<b>Fortunes</b>

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:58.570
Inko-chan, you should draw one as well.
<b>Fortunes</b>

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.830
It's fun!
<b>Fortunes</b>

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:00.830
<b>Fortunes</b>

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.210
What did I get?

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:06.110
"Great misfortune" again!

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:08.340
What about you, Inko-chan?

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.960
"G-Great fortune"?!

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.720
<b>Great Fortune
"G-Great fortune"?!</b>

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:13.300
"G-Great fortune"?!

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:21.230
Inko-chan, that's amazing!

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:23.390
I won't lose!

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:23.480
Sacchin!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.480
<b>Great Fortune
Sacchin!</b>

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:25.690
<b>Great Fortune</b>

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.160
Are you okay?

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:39.910
Y-Yeah.

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:45.040
It fell asleep.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.190
Today was fun, wasn't it?

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:50.050
Let's hang out again sometime!

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:51.590
No?

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.380
Um...

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:54.680
Oh, right.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.800
You can have one of the protective charms.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.220
I bought too many.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:03.480
But eventually, we will...

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.980
Yeah, so let's pray to have a good battle!

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:10.050
I mean, it's not like we're quarreling.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:13.820
Once the battle's over, we can all become good friends, right?

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:20.200
"For a good partner".

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.540
You can pick a different one.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:25.270
Are you sure?

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:26.910
This is good.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.290
All right, then!

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:31.050
Thank you. I'll treasure it.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.800
Glad to hear you like it.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.590
I've gotta go home now.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:42.010
Bye-bye, Inko-chan!

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.610
For a good partner

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:49.230
<b>Kiss practice</b>

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.560
Hanzou-san.
<b>Kiss practice</b>

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:52.940
We will begin the strategy meeting soon.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.650
Okay.

00:13:56.740 --> 00:14:00.530
What do you think of Muneakira-san?

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:01.030
Huh?

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:05.750
I mean, if Milady and Muneakira-san were bound together,

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:09.590
Muneakira-san might decide to use me too.

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:12.040
Isn't it the same for you, Matabei-san?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.770
If Yukimura-san and Muneakira-san were bound together,

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:17.050
he would become your master too.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:20.050
He's very reliable.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:24.220
Yeah, he is.

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:24.970
Yeah.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.110
Muneakira-san?

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:40.150
Matabei-san and Hanzou-san have just arrived.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:45.240
Yeah, I know what's going on over there as if I was there myself.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.250
All right! The experiment was a success.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:49.370
Return home.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:55.170
I was trying out telepathy with Yukimura.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.630
What is telepathy?

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:02.090
It's a technique for a General and a Master Samurai to know each other's situation.

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:05.790
Because we mastered the control of our qi,

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:10.690
telepathy has become a lot easier than before.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.610
It'll be useful when searching for the slasher tonight.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.320
I see.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:18.440
We'll do our best to support you.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.570
Right! I'll be counting on you!

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:24.450
Late Night

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:28.120
Strategy Meeting

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.750
Is everything clear?

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.920
We'll split up the area as we just agreed.

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:36.130
If we find something, we'll contact each other using telepathy.

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:42.750
Whoever the culprit is, it's clear that they're a strong qi user.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:43.890
We mustn't overexert ourselves.

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:45.260
Understood?

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.760
Yes, sir!

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.180
Team A

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.110
Team K

00:15:58.820 --> 00:15:59.990
Team B

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:05.570
Say, Hanzou.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.740
What is it, milady?

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:11.910
Do you want to become a Master Samurai?

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.290
Wh-What do you mean?

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:17.420
I hope you're not scheming to become the Samurai Bride yourself!

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.340
O-Of course not!

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:23.470
Let me make this clear! Neither I nor anyone else will become the Samurai Bride!

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:25.070
N-Naturally!

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:28.260
I'm just conscious of my own lack of power.

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:36.560
Maybe if I remained in your service while Muneakira-san became my General...

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:39.670
Milady?

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:44.320
Until now, the slasher always attacked people who were alone.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:44.910
Yes.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:49.280
Then it won't show up if we're in pairs.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.080
I'll go on by myself!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:56.460
You hide so it doesn't notice you!

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:56.920
But-

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.790
Don't worry.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:01.920
If anything happens, I'll contact everyone through telepathy.

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:03.840
M-Milady!

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:12.020
The streets are pretty empty at night after rumors spread about the slasher.

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:13.850
Look, a crow!

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:16.810
There were some in the garden during the day too.

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:22.990
A person?

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:24.050
It's Inko-chan!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.070
Juubei! Wait!

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:32.330
Hanzou!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:35.330
The slasher won't come out if you're so close to me!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.830
B-But...

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.290
Get further away!

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:38.960
A-As you wish!

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.840
Goodness.

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:46.090
That seems like the perfect spot.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:49.410
We're at the same spot as last night.

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:50.930
Will it show up again?

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:53.610
We were deeply shamed last night!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:55.140
I sure hope it shows up again!

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:58.650
Matabei! Sasuke! Don't let your guard down!

00:17:58.650 --> 00:17:59.900
Yes.

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:08.530
Wait, Inko-chan!

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:12.410
Wait, where am I?

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.870
Where's Onii-chan?!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.700
What should I do?

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:23.340
There you are, slasher.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.090
You won't have your way with me as you did with Yukimura!

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:30.090
That's a really fearsome qi.

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:31.930
No surprise Yukimura lost to you.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:34.230
But a Master Samurai—

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:40.770
This can't be!

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:42.310
Where's the Guardian Stone?!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:43.020
I can't move!

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:44.650
What's that? Don't tell me!

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:45.820
Milady!

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:57.040
Ah, the Tokugawa princess?

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:59.500
If anyone would know, it'd be you!

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:01.500
Tell me where the Guardian Stone is!

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:03.290
H-Help me!

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:09.630
Let go of milady!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.950
Impossible! My fan!

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:15.350
Damn small fry! Get lost!

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:22.020
Hanzou-san!

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:27.690
Are you all right?

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:29.610
Yes.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.700
There you are, slasher!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.450
I'll fight you!

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:36.330
Fan Shield!

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.420
Oh, you're a Master Samurai?

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:46.750
I hope you're ready. It won't be as easy as last night.

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:49.670
What are these feathers?

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:50.470
Could it-

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.010
Damn you!

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.470
You're gonna get in my way again?!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.690
Onii-chan!

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:04.730
So bright!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:17.580
Onii-chan!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:18.870
Juubei!

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.080
Where is it?

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:21.710
Oh, no!

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:22.790
Milady!

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.170
Are you okay, milady?

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:27.210
Y-Yes.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.690
Princess Sen, are you hurt?

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:31.330
I'm fine. Where is the enemy?

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:34.590
I can't sense their qi. They seem to be gone.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:38.450
I let my guard down. I was totally defeated.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.600
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:43.100
I was really lucky.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.600
This isn't right!

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:49.330
We almost lost you, milady.

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:50.360
Hanzou-san...

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:54.990
I can't help you if I lack the strength.

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:56.130
Hanzou...

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:58.370
I want to become stronger.

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:02.410
Yukimura-sama!

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:06.010
Thank goodness. They're all right too.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:08.460
Beta-san! Sacchin!

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.770
Are you all okay?

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:13.220
Yeah, we're all fine!

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:15.720
What is it, Juubei-san?

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:17.220
Inko-chan!

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:19.290
A Dark Samurai!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.590
Why is she here?

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:23.430
Come over here, quick!

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:27.520
Was Houzouin Inshun the slasher?

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:32.610
It can't be. Inko-chan...

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.740
Episode Eight

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:12.960
Matabei-san! Matabei-san!

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:15.130
Have you seen the next episode's title?

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:17.110
This feeling of déjà vu...

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:21.410
Guess what! It's "A New Master Samurai"!

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:27.350
This time, either you or me will definitely become a Master Samurai!

00:23:27.350 --> 00:23:28.270
I'm positive!

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:30.480
You shouldn't count your chickens before they hatch.

00:23:31.230 --> 00:23:33.560
Who will it be?

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:37.690
Next time: Hanzou, the New Master Samurai.

00:23:37.690 --> 00:23:39.990
I thought it was "A New Master Samurai."
